<div class="span9 about-main-image">
<div class="span6 about-description"><h2>What Are We Planning for the Site?&nbsp;</h2>
<p>The NYC Department of Housing Preservation and Development (HPD) is planning for development of affordable homeownership and community amenities at 1337 Jerome Avenue in Mount Eden neighborhood of The Bronx. HPD does this planning in collaboration with the community, so keep reading to find out how to get involved!&nbsp;</p>
<p><span class="EOP Selected SCXW46979354 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}">This site is part of the Neighborhood Builders Fast Track Initiative. Visit the<span>&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.nyc.gov/site/hpd/services-and-information/neighborhood-builders-rfps.page">Neighborhood Builders Home Page<span>&nbsp;</span></a><span>to learn more</span></p>
<p><a href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=x2_1MoFfIk6pWxXaZlE774kGaK00cf5BiJz5LF4M5EZUQlZNNE85UTRNSjNSTUo0WVhTRDFHUVpWTC4u"><img src="/assets/hpd/images/content/pages/questionnaire.jpg" alt="" width="675" height="65" /></a></p>
<h3 aria-level="1"><strong><span data-contrast="none">Site Overview</span></strong><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}">&nbsp;</span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">1337 Jerome Avenue is an approximately 6,516 square foot site in the Mount Eden neighborhood of Bronx Community District </span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">4</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW187168957 BCX8">.</span><span class="NormalTextRun CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW187168957 BCX8"> </span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">The lot </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">contains</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"> a vacant one-story commercial building</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun Highlight SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">which most recently served as a<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW187168957 BCX8">City</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span>&nbsp;</span>pest control facility until 2013. The building</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">will be demolished as part of the redevelopment. The site faces the elevated 4 subway line along the Jerome Avenue commercial corridor, </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8">in close proximity to</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW187168957 BCX8"> the 170th Street Station. </span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW187168957 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:150,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h3><img src="/assets/hpd/images/content/pages/1337-jerome-av-site-context .jpg" width="2250" height="1800" /></h3>
<div>
<h3><span data-ccp-props="{}"><strong>Project Background</strong>&nbsp;</span></h3>
<p>The City committed to creating affordable homeownership opportunities on this site as part of the <a href="https://www.nyc.gov/content/planning/pages/our-work/plans/citywide/city-of-yes-housing-opportunity">2024 City Of Yes Housing Opportunity</a> citywide zoning text amendment. The site will be developed using HPD&rsquo;s Open Door program, which funds the new construction of homeownership cooperative buildings affordable to low-, moderate-, and middle-income households. &nbsp;&nbsp;<span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p>The site is in the Jerome Special District with an R8A zoning district and a C2-4 commercial overlay. HPD is exploring the potential for a rezoning to allow the new building &nbsp;to house as many New Yorkers as possible, while providing space for community amenities along Jerome Ave and ensuring the building&rsquo;s shape and height are contextual to the surrounding neighborhood.</p>
</div>
<h3><strong>What Phase of the </strong><strong>RFP Process Are We In?&nbsp;</strong><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></h3>
<div>
<p>To read more about the Request For Proposals (RFP) process, please visit the <a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/neighborhood-builders-fast-track-home.page">Neighborhood Builders Fast Track RFPs</a> webpage.&nbsp;</p>
<p><br /></p>
<h3><img src="/assets/hpd/images/content/pages/rfp-process-faq.jpg" alt="" width="3930" height="624" /></h3>
<h3><br /></h3>
<h3>1. Community Visioning&nbsp;</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW51613698 BCX8"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW51613698 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="normaltextrun" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;Aptos&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Aptos,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}">We want your input on the future of this site! The community visioning phase is your chance to help shape the RFP for the new<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW51613698 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="normaltextrun">affordable housing and<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW51613698 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="normaltextrun">community amenities. Check out more engagement opportunities below:</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW51613698 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="eop" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;920dbcde-2834-5e15-a5fa-062170b236ba|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;Aptos&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Aptos,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;eop&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;eop&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}"> </span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW51613698 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:150}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h3><strong>How to Get Involved</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Tell us what you think about this future development by filling out the&nbsp;<a href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=x2_1MoFfIk6pWxXaZlE774kGaK00cf5BiJz5LF4M5EZUQlZNNE85UTRNSjNSTUo0WVhTRDFHUVpWTC4u"><strong>Project Questionnaire</strong></a>&nbsp;by October 16!&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<div class="faq-v1">
<div class="faq-head">
<div class="faq-controls"><a href="javascript:expandAll();" class="faq-expand-all">Expand All</a><a href="javascript:collapseAll();" class="faq-collapse-all">Collapse All</a></div>
</div>
<div data-answer="faq1a" class="faq-questions">
<p>Upcoming Events</p>
</div>
<div class="faq-answers" id="faq1a">
<ul>
<li>September 29, 2026 &ndash; We will be tabling in front of the site, 1337 Jerome Avenue from 10am-12pm&nbsp;</li>
<li>September 30, 2026 &ndash; We will be flyering near the site along Jerome Avenue from 5pm-7pm</li>
<li>October 3, 2026 &ndash; We will be tabling at the New Settlement Community Center located at the corner of, 1501 Jerome Avenue, W 172nd St, Bronx, NY 10452 from 12pm-2pm</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div data-answer="faq2a" class="faq-questions">
<p>What We&rsquo;ve Done So Far</p>
</div>
<div class="faq-answers" id="faq2a">
<ul>
<li>September 14, 2026 &ndash; We met with Bronx Community Board 4 to introduce the project
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href="/assets/hpd/downloads/pdfs/services/1337-Jerome-CB4-briefing.pdf">Presentation Slides </a></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<h3>Request for Proposals (RFP)</h3>
<p>HPD will release an RFP for the 1337 Jerome Ave site to developers selected from the Neighborhood Builders Pre-Qualified List in Fall 2026. Stay tuned for more information!</p>
<p>Please visit the <a href="/site/hpd/services-and-information/neighborhood-builders-rfps.page">Neighborhood Builders Fast Track</a> webpage for Frequently Asked Questions about the Neighborhood Builders development process.</p>
<h3>Sign Up to Receive Updates</h3>
<p>Please sign up below to stay informed about community engagement opportunities! You can also email any questions to <a href="mailto:1337Jerome@hpd.nyc.gov">1337Jerome@hpd.nyc.gov.</a></p>
